This product is a re-implementation in SPARK/Ada of the Unishox2 short-string compression
algorithm, including its default code tables (USX_HCODES_DFLT, USX_HCODE_LENS_DFLT,
USX_FREQ_SEQ_DFLT, USX_TEMPLATES, the character sets, the vertical codes and the count and
Unicode delta codes).

